@startuml
title UC-001系统时序图 v0.1
actor 学生 as Student
participant 选课系统 as System
participant 教务基础数据系统 as Registry

Student -> System : 提交选课请求(studentId, courseId)
System -> Registry : 查询学生资格和课程状态
Registry --> System : 返回基础数据
System -> System : 检查重复和容量
alt 所有规则通过
  System -> System : 新增Enrollment
  System --> Student : SUCCESS(enrollmentId)
else 学生状态异常
  System --> Student : STUDENT_INACTIVE
else 课程关闭
  System --> Student : COURSE_CLOSED
else 已经选过
  System --> Student : DUPLICATE_ENROLLMENT
else 人数达到容量
  System --> Student : COURSE_FULL
end
@enduml
